  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Button/LinkButton (@/app/components/ui), variant primary: the club's fill, one per area.",
      "html": "<span style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Pay <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:6px;font:500 0.9375rem/1.2 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out,color 120ms ease-out;border:1px solid var(--club);background-color:var(--club);color:var(--club-on)}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background-image:linear-gradient(var(--overlay),var(--overlay))}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Button/LinkButton variant secondary: every other action, and every Pay but the soonest.",
      "html": "<span style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><button class=\"ds-btn-secondary\">See your payments</button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:6px;font:500 0.9375rem/1.2 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out,color 120ms ease-out;border:1px solid var(--border-control);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}.ds-btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--surface-muted)}.ds-btn-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quiet Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-quiet",
      "description": "Button variant quiet: a small action in words, in club text.",
      "html": "<span style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><button class=\"ds-btn-quiet\">Change name</button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-quiet{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:6px;font:500 0.9375rem/1.2 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out,color 120ms ease-out;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--club-text)}.ds-btn-quiet:hover{background:var(--club-tint)}.ds-btn-quiet:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Danger Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Button variant danger: removes or ends something, said in red.",
      "html": "<span style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><button class=\"ds-btn-danger\">Remove</button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-danger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:6px;font:500 0.9375rem/1.2 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out,color 120ms ease-out;border:1px solid var(--border-control);background:var(--surface);color:var(--late)}.ds-btn-danger:hover{background:var(--late-soft);border-color:var(--late)}.ds-btn-danger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "TextInput (@/app/components/ui): a label over a 44px control with a strong edge; hint tied by aria-describedby.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\" style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><span class=\"ds-field-label\">The family's name</span><input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"Rivera Family\"><span class=\"ds-field-hint\">As it shows to the family</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:grid;gap:6px;max-width:22rem}.ds-field-label{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}.ds-field-hint{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-input{font:400 1rem/1.5 inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:6px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px;transition:border-color 120ms ease-out}.ds-input:hover{border-color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--club-text)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "List with rows",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "list-row",
      "description": "SectionLabel over List + ListRow: status ring, title, meta line, amount, compact action. The signature of the system.",
      "html": "<div style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--ground);padding:16px\"><h3 class=\"ds-label\">To do</h3><ul class=\"ds-list\"><li class=\"ds-row\"><svg class=\"ds-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"color:var(--late)\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M8 4.6v4.2M8 11.2v.1\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-main\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Invoice QZ-1042</span><span class=\"ds-meta\"><span style=\"color:var(--late);font-weight:500\">Was due Nov 2</span></span></div><div class=\"ds-trail\"><span class=\"ds-amt\">$100.00</span><a class=\"ds-pay\" href=\"#\">Pay</a></div></li><li class=\"ds-row\"><svg class=\"ds-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" style=\"color:var(--due)\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 4.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 11.5 8H8z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-main\"><span class=\"ds-title\">Uniform fitting attended</span><span class=\"ds-meta\"><span style=\"color:var(--due);font-weight:500\">Not done yet</span> · Yaretzi</span></div></li></ul></div>",
      "css": ".ds-label{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-2);margin:0 0 8px}.ds-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}.ds-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;min-height:56px;padding:10px 16px}.ds-row+.ds-row{border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.ds-row:hover{background:var(--surface-muted)}.ds-ring{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;margin-top:3px}.ds-main{flex:1;display:grid;gap:1px;min-width:0}.ds-title{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}.ds-meta{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}.ds-trail{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;align-self:center}.ds-amt{font-weight:500;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-pay{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--club);color:var(--club-on);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}.ds-pay:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Card (@/app/components/ui): a white surface, hairline, 8px corner, title and a foot of actions. No shadow.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\" style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\"><h2>Total owed <span class=\"ds-card-amt\">$185.00</span></h2><p class=\"ds-card-asof\">Owed now. From QuickBooks, as of 6:19 PM.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:20px;color:var(--ink);max-width:24rem}.ds-card h2{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:0;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.011em}.ds-card-amt{font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:-.018em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums lining-nums}.ds-card-asof{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink-2)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Badges",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge",
      "description": "StatusBadge (@/app/components/ui): a tone's icon and words on its soft tint, 4px corner. Four tones only.",
      "html": "<span style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-done\">Paid</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-due\">2 to sign</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-late\">Overdue</span><span class=\"ds-badge\">Not started</span></span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--neutral-soft);color:var(--ink-2);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.5}.ds-done{background:var(--done-soft);color:var(--done)}.ds-due{background:var(--due-soft);color:var(--due)}.ds-late{background:var(--late-soft);color:var(--late)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "notice-warning",
      "description": "Notice (src/app/components/notice.tsx): a status on its tone's tint, icon and word in the tone, body in ink.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notice\" style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;\" role=\"status\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 2.5l8 14.5H2L10 2.5z\"/><path d=\"M10 8v4\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"14.6\" r=\".8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><div><b>Needs attention</b> QuickBooks needs connecting again. Payments are paused until it is.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-notice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--due-soft);color:var(--ink);font-size:.9375rem;max-width:32rem}.ds-notice svg{width:20px;height:20px;margin-top:2px;color:var(--due)}.ds-notice b{color:var(--due);font-weight:600;margin-right:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Club bar and tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "club-bar",
      "description": "ClubBar and ParentTabs: a white 56px bar with the logo tile; the phone's tab bar with the current tab on the club tint.",
      "html": "<div style=\"--club:#5b2a86;--club-on:#fff;--club-text:#5b2a86;--club-tint:#f1ebf6;--ground:#f7f7f8;--surface:#fff;--surface-muted:#f2f2f4;--border:#e3e4e8;--border-control:#cfd2d8;--border-strong:#8a8e98;--ink:#18191d;--ink-2:#5c606a;--ink-3:#8a8e98;--done:#1d7344;--due:#955400;--late:#b3261e;--done-soft:#e7f4ec;--due-soft:#fcf1df;--late-soft:#fceceb;--neutral-soft:#f0f1f3;--overlay:rgb(0 0 0 / .08);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--ground)\"><div class=\"ds-bar\"><span class=\"ds-tile\">E2E</span><span class=\"ds-club\">E2E Boosters</span><a class=\"ds-nav ds-here\" href=\"#\">Home</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#\">Forms</a><span class=\"ds-acct\">ZQ</span></div><nav class=\"ds-tabs\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-tab ds-tab-here\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 11l8-7 8 7v9H4z\"/></svg>Home</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-tab\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"/></svg>Payments</a></nav></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:56px;padding:0 16px;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.ds-tile{height:32px;min-width:32px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--club);color:var(--club-on);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700}.ds-club{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin-right:auto}.ds-nav{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}.ds-nav:hover{background:var(--surface-muted);color:var(--ink)}.ds-here{background:var(--club-tint);color:var(--club-text);font-weight:600}.ds-nav:focus-visible,.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--club-text,#5b2a86);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-acct{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface-muted);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600}.ds-tabs{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:1fr;background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:48px}.ds-tab{min-height:64px;display:grid;place-items:center;align-content:center;gap:2px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none}.ds-tab svg{width:48px;height:28px;padding:3px 13px;border-radius:999px}.ds-tab-here{color:var(--club-text);font-weight:600}.ds-tab-here svg{background:var(--club-tint)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Calm Standard",
    "overview": "Booster Rocket reads like a quiet, well-organized product of its category: structure comes from spacing, grouping and a strict type scale, not from heavy rules, boxes inside boxes or drop shadows. A near-white ground carries white surfaces with a 1px hairline and an 8px corner; Inter is the one face; near-black ink and one gray carry every word. The club's own color is an accent and nothing more: the primary button, the current place in the menu, the focus ring and the small logo tile in a white top bar.\n\nThe system is white-label. Each club supplies one color at runtime and the app derives every club role from it, checked against every ground of every display mode. The club leads; Booster Rocket is credited in the footer (\"Runs on Booster Rocket\"), never featured. The same layout is drawn in four display modes (light, dark, and high contrast for each), at three text sizes, with reduced motion and under Windows contrast themes; only token values change between them.\n\nParents are every age, often on older phones, so the category's density is translated humanely: body text is 1rem, nothing is set under 0.8125rem, every control is at least 44px tall, and WCAG 2.2 AA holds throughout. Staff at laptops get the same world denser, in DataTables, never smaller than that floor. Status is always words plus a small drawn icon, in four tones only.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Near-white ground, white surfaces, 1px hairlines, corners of 8px (surfaces), 6px (controls) and 4px (badges).",
      "One face, Inter, self-hosted; tabular figures only where a figure is read as a figure.",
      "The club's color derived at runtime into fill, ink-on-fill, text and tint roles, used as an accent only.",
      "Lists over tables for what a person acts on: a section label over one bordered list of rows, each a status ring, a title, a meta line, then an amount or a compact action.",
      "Four status tones (done, due, late, neutral), always words plus an icon.",
      "No shadow anywhere except under menus and popovers."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Accent-Only Rule",
        "body": "The club fill is for the primary button, the logo tile and the current step's track. Everywhere else the club appears as `club-text` or `club-tint`. The top bar and the tab bar are white surfaces, never the club's color.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Derived Club Rule",
        "body": "A club picks one color; the app computes `club-on`, the four `club-text-*` tones and both `club-tint-*` washes. No club color can produce text under 4.5:1 (7:1 in high contrast) on any ground of its mode; `club` and `club-on` never change between modes.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Four Tones Rule",
        "body": "A status has one of four tones: done, due, late, neutral (`Tone`, `src/app/components/ui/tone.ts`). Information is ink on the neutral tint, never a blue. No fifth status color.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Measured Pair Rule",
